{
	quest.03F57B09CCB0F030.quest_desc: ["It's possible to apply an Elixir to an Amethyst Throwing Dagger in the Athanor, inflicting its effects on the target."]
	quest.03F57B09CCB0F030.title: "Tipped Throwing Daggers"
	quest.069B39105A0D32A9.quest_desc: ["The Tabula Vitae allows you to craft using your &4Essentia Vitae&r provided by an &cOrb&r. In addition to simpler recipes, the Tabula can be used for alchemy, producing elixirs and anointments to strengthen a Vitaemancer and their gear."]
	quest.069B39105A0D32A9.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's Workbench"
	quest.0A34EE0389E5F6BD.quest_desc: ["Five million &5Anima&r, equivalent to a thousand &cNovicius Orbs&r."]
	quest.0A34EE0389E5F6BD.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier IV"
	quest.0CA2D7689612E403.quest_subtitle: "Power beyond the Weak Crystal's reach"
	quest.0CBD78CE57688C20.title: "Spiritus Crystals"
	quest.14A9904D4ACB3ED1.quest_desc: ["The second tier of &9Orb&r opens up significant capabilities as a Vitaemancer. Your 150,000 &5Anima&r capacity is enough to open the &3Demon Realm&r, and the &9Orb&r is powerful enough to craft the Athanor, unlocking a multitude of new techniques and resources."]
	quest.14A9904D4ACB3ED1.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier II"
	quest.1B63D4B24B30C20F.quest_desc: [
		"When placed withing the Athanor, the &1Hydration Cell&r has many uses:"
		""
		"- Turning dirt into mud"
		"- Stripping &zdyes&r"
		"- &3Oxidising&r &6Copper&r"
		"- &2Growing moss&r on cobblestone"
	]
	quest.1B63D4B24B30C20F.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's Well"
	quest.1B63D4B24B30C20F.title: "Hydrating"
	quest.1BA15CF10FD2E961.quest_desc: ["The third tier of &eOrb&r provides a capacity of 1,000,000 &5Anima&r, opening the door to more elaborate rituals."]
	quest.1BA15CF10FD2E961.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier III"
	quest.1F127DF65F360647.quest_subtitle: "Breaching the deeper workings"
	quest.1F127DF65F360647.title: "The Mines"
	quest.1F4824994F6CDAFA.quest_subtitle: "Aura Farming...?"
	quest.1F4824994F6CDAFA.title: "Burning Spiritus"
	quest.206BD489C4CD4FD4.quest_desc: ["Offering a Redstone Block to the &6altar&r rewards you with a greater &9Orb&r, allowing you to craft more powerful items, including the Arcane Scribe Tool."]
	quest.206BD489C4CD4FD4.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier I"
	quest.2072F1FCBAC1991A.quest_desc: [
		"One hundred and seventy-two runes. The pinnacle of Vitaemancy. Crystal clusters forged with remnants of the Deep Dark and the Wither cap off the Tier VI &6Ara Vitae&r."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/ara_t6.png width:150 height:105 align:center}"
	]
	quest.2072F1FCBAC1991A.quest_subtitle: "A Cathedral of Blood and Stone"
	quest.2072F1FCBAC1991A.title: "Ara Tier VI"
	quest.20FE6C7DE3D6206E.quest_desc: ["The Athanor is a crucible fueled by &4Essentia Vitae&r that transcends mere smelting. Within it, an experienced Vitaemancer can cover dry stone with moss, disenchant equipment, unmake the most powerful of runes, and, most importantly, distill &cSaturated Tau&r into &4Weak Blood Shards&r."]
	quest.20FE6C7DE3D6206E.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's Furnace"
	quest.20FE6C7DE3D6206E.title: "The Athanor"
	quest.2109EC9682B1837B.quest_desc: [
		"Your journey deeper into the &3Demon Realm&r and its &3Mines&r rewards you with &3Hellforged Blocks&r, allowing the &6altar&r to ascend to Tier V. It stands proud, adorned with one hundred runes, a feat of Vitaemancy."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/ara_t5.png width:150 height:115 align:center click_action:none:}"
	]
	quest.2109EC9682B1837B.quest_subtitle: "Few Vitaemancers dare reach this height."
	quest.2109EC9682B1837B.title: "Ara Tier V"
	quest.217471D1622EEB43.quest_subtitle: "Folding the fabric of reality"
	quest.21CD311485F6CF64.quest_desc: ["Runes are the gateway to a greater &6altar&r, the next rung on the ladder of Vitaemancy. These blank runes do little by themselves, but serve as the building block for &6altar&r upgrades, both to raise the tier and increase its performance."]
	quest.21CD311485F6CF64.title: "Blank Runes"
	quest.26450B2EC4BF4BC5.quest_desc: [
		"Runes in hand, you raise the &6altar&r to Tier II. Blank runes will get the job done, but they can be replaced with upgraded ones at the cardinals should you wish."
		""
		"The empty space beneath and around the &6Ara&r here and at subsequent tiers can be filled to your needs and liking."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/ara_t2.png width:150 height:115 align:1}"
	]
	quest.26450B2EC4BF4BC5.quest_subtitle: "The Ara stirs with new hunger."
	quest.26450B2EC4BF4BC5.title: "Ara Tier II"
	quest.26BF54453DC1E72A.title: "Crystal Automation"
	quest.286C9B7D5F16D05C.quest_desc: [
		"Having ventured to the edge of the &3Demon Realm&r, another twenty-eight runes and four more pillars capped with Bloodstone bring the &6Ara&r to its fourth tier."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/ara_t4.png width:150 height:80 align:center click_action:none:}"
	]
	quest.286C9B7D5F16D05C.quest_subtitle: "The Ara groans with barely-contained power."
	quest.286C9B7D5F16D05C.title: "Ara Tier IV"
	quest.2A1CBBFF9F40A2E1.quest_desc: [
		"Before you attempt your first ritual, it's worth taking the time to understand the &5Anima Network&r. It's your invisible storage of &4Essentia Vitae&r across chunks and dimensions, and the &eDivination Sigil&r is your eye into it."
		""
		"The capacity of your &5Anima&r is determined by your &9Orb&r. To check how full it is, use the &esigil&r on empty air."
		""
		"Placing an &9Orb&r with stored &4EV&r into an &6Ara&r will drain it to quickly fill the &6altar&r. If it's already full, the &4EV&r will fill your &5Anima&r instead."
	]
	quest.2A1CBBFF9F40A2E1.quest_subtitle: "A lens into the unseen"
	quest.2A1CBBFF9F40A2E1.title: "The Anima Network"
	quest.2AC336C29FA5B990.quest_subtitle: "Did somebody say pattern provider?"
	quest.2AC336C29FA5B990.title: "The Routing Network"
	quest.2B80B9B87D3D586D.quest_desc: [
		"Weaving your &4Essentia Vitae&r into the brewing process allows you to transcend the limitations of traditional alchemy."
		""
		"In addition to making several new effects available, these elixirs can contain combinations of regular potion effects. To do so, simply use an existing flask in place of an empty one."
	]
	quest.2B80B9B87D3D586D.quest_subtitle: "Elixirs worthy of the name"
	quest.337C20F81B4701B7.title: "Slimes of Vitae"
	quest.374C299FCEA3E243.quest_desc: [
		"With any luck, the &cAntechamber&r's &cSpirit Caches&r contain &cTau Fruit&r, the key to furthering your progress in Vitaemancy."
		""
		"It's possible to grow &cTau&r like any other crop and refine it into &coil&r, which has a range of uses, but it's not what you're after right now."
		""
		"There exists an alternative method to growing &cTau&r. As it grows, it draws from the &4vitality&r of living creatues on top of it, filling itself with &4Essentia Vitae&r. This &cSaturated Tau&r can be refined further to elevate the &6altar&r and craft stronger &9Orbs&r."
	]
	quest.374C299FCEA3E243.quest_subtitle: "A darker method of cultivation"
	quest.374C299FCEA3E243.title: "Tau Fruit"
	quest.37F69B333C97AC32.quest_subtitle: "Armor that learns from you"
	quest.37F69B333C97AC32.title: "Sentient Armor"
	quest.3ECA3E639BB3BD06.quest_subtitle: "The deeper you delve, the more the realm reveals."
	quest.3ECA3E639BB3BD06.title: "The Endless Dungeon"
	quest.3FE985383428D23D.quest_desc: [
		"Ore Processing is a relatively simple but rewarding process in Neo Vitae. It goes as follows:"
		""
		"- Add &ccutting fluid&r to the ore or raw metal to produce fragments."
		"- Use a resonator on the fragments to produce gravel."
		"- Add more &ccutting fluid&r to the gravel to turn it into dust."
		"- Smelt the dust into ingots."
	]
	quest.3FE985383428D23D.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's... Mekanism?"
	quest.3FE985383428D23D.title: "Ore Processing"
	quest.41FAB9A31125F9E6.quest_desc: [
		"Through rituals, you are able to manifest your &4Essentia Vitae&r into profound effects on the world around you. Performing one is relatively simple:"
		""
		"- Firstly, place a Master Ritual Stone where you intend to start the ritual."
		"- Secondly, use the Ritual Diviner on empty air and select your ritual of choice. Use it on the Master Stone to inscribe the ritual."
		"- Finally, ensure you have sufficient &5Anima&r and use an Activation Crystal on the Master Stone."
		""
		"For a full list of rituals and their effects, see the &4Scriptura Vitae&r."
	]
	quest.41FAB9A31125F9E6.quest_subtitle: "Inscribing circles of greater power"
	quest.41FAB9A31125F9E6.title: "Rituals"
	quest.423BC6A088DFA15E.quest_desc: [
		"Crafting is only the beginning of the Alchemy Array. Its utility extends to environmental controls, defenses, traps and even simple farms."
		""
		"There's too much to cover with quests alone, so check the &4Scriptura Vitae&r if you're curious."
	]
	quest.423BC6A088DFA15E.title: "Beyond Crafting"
	quest.424F68635A22A0DE.title: "Aspected Crystals"
	quest.467D5423924F6630.title: "Capacity Rune"
	quest.46A33EFA9641F0BE.quest_subtitle: "Ore mined from Hell itself"
	quest.46A33EFA9641F0BE.title: "Mining for Demonite"
	quest.48241C5AA8ABFA16.quest_desc: [
		"Where Elixirs empower the body, anointments empower the hand."
		""
		"Like enchantments, they are applied to your equipment but, unlike enchantments, they decay with every use of the tool until there is nothing left and they must be reapplied."
		""
		"Fortunately, it is possible to extend the lifetime of your anointments using &cTau Oil&r and &3Hellforged Dust&r as you progress the art."
	]
	quest.48241C5AA8ABFA16.title: "Anointments"
	quest.4FD5066EED19F5F1.quest_desc: [
		"You'll quickly find that the Tabula Rasa is only useful for so many crafts. For each &6Ara&r tier you construct, an additional Tabula becomes available."
		""
		"To craft the next tier of Tabula, offer the previous one to the &6altar&r."
	]
	quest.4FD5066EED19F5F1.title: "Better Tabulae"
	quest.50815F48B9179B1F.quest_desc: [
		"Tabula Rasa is the fundamental substrate for all of a Vitaemancer's runes and sigils. It's crafted in the &6Ara&r from deepslate."
		""
		"This one should be faster than the &cOrb&r, assuming you're willing to &4sacrifice&r some more of yourself."
	]
	quest.538E28637FF76912.quest_desc: ["This Quest has been authored by &6AllTheMods Staff&r, or a &2Community contributor&r for use in AllTheMods Modpacks. \\n\\nAs all &6AllTheMods&r packs are licensed under &eAll Rights Reserved&r, this Quest is not allowed to be used in any public packs not released by &6AllTheMods Team&r without explicit permission. \\n\\nThis quest is intentionally hidden, if you're seeing this, you're in editing mode."]
	quest.56CCFFCF62914EAD.quest_subtitle: "Stronger, deeper currents"
	quest.56CCFFCF62914EAD.title: "Routing Upgrades"
	quest.60CC4446A2280152.quest_desc: [
		"The &bSentient Tools&r barely match Iron when starved of &bSpiritus&r, but don't judge them too harshly. When fuelled by a full &bgem&r, they surpass Netherite in strength and durability."
		""
		"Speaking of durability, all &bSentient equipment&r can be repaired in an anvil using crystallized &bSpiritus&r."
	]
	quest.60CC4446A2280152.title: "Sentient Tools"
	quest.6117BC77F2F38AD9.quest_desc: ["Before rituals, sigils and the greater workings of Vitaemancy, there was the Alchemy Array. After inscribing runes into the ground, a Vitaemancer can craft reagents and sigils on the floor in front of them by adding ingredients to the circle."]
	quest.6117BC77F2F38AD9.quest_subtitle: "Circles inscribed by hand"
	quest.6117BC77F2F38AD9.title: "The Alchemy Array"
	quest.61E2740D6817748E.quest_desc: [
		"Neo Vitae is a modern blood magic mod based on, well, Blood Magic."
		""
		"You first step on the journey of Vitaemancy is to construct the &6Ara Vitae&r. It's initially bare, but will suffice for now."
	]
	quest.61E2740D6817748E.quest_subtitle: "A journey written in blood"
	quest.61E2740D6817748E.title: "Neo Vitae"
	quest.66827D0DD7CCD3E7.quest_desc: [
		"&bSpiritus&r is the physical manifestation of the malevolence inside every mortal creature. It powers the Hellfire Forge, allowing you to craft &bsentient equipment&r that learns from your actions."
		""
		"As a fledgeling Vitaemancer, your only means of harvesting &bSpiritus&r is using &bThrowing Daggers&r. They mark the creatures they hit, causing them to drop &bSpiritus&r when slain. Don't worry if you miss - the daggers can be picked up from the blocks they hit."
	]
	quest.66827D0DD7CCD3E7.quest_subtitle: "The Currency of the Soul"
	quest.66827D0DD7CCD3E7.title: "Harvesting Spiritus"
	quest.711C0EFAB083E742.quest_desc: ["&cSaturated Tau&r can be refined in the Athanor to produce &4Weak Blood Shards&r, used to craft &4Bloodstone&r and the third tier of &9Orb&r."]
	quest.711C0EFAB083E742.quest_subtitle: "Unsettling beauty"
	quest.736C00F917B82E90.quest_desc: [
		"The Sanguine Reverter is a simple but useful tool in a Vitaemancer's arsenal."
		""
		"In the Athanor, it can separate enchantments onto individual books and unmake Reinforced Runes and &9Orbs&r."
	]
	quest.736C00F917B82E90.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's Grindstone"
	quest.736C00F917B82E90.title: "Disenchanting"
	quest.740193EA8DB5095B.quest_desc: ["The &bSentient Sword&r is a far more elegant instrument of &bSpiritus&r gathering than crude daggers. All felled enemies drop &bSpiritus&r when slain using it, feeding on every drop of &bessence&r you carry to grow stronger."]
	quest.74C627D2A8822A07.quest_desc: ["Like the &bSword&r, the &bSentient Scythe&r grows with the &bSpiritus&r you carry. Initially blunt and useful solely as a hoe, the &bScythe&r develops into a vicious tool for reaping, dealing full damage to every enemy caught in its swing to tear through hordes with ease."]
	quest.78A828BF48F3F449.quest_desc: [
		"Another sixteen runes allow you to elevate the &6altar&r again, making a potential twenty-four upgrades available. Around it, four pillars capped with Blood Stained Glass guide the &4essence&r to the Tier III &6Ara&r."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/ara_t3.png width:150 height:101 align:center}"
	]
	quest.78A828BF48F3F449.quest_subtitle: "The altar's hunger deepens."
	quest.78A828BF48F3F449.title: "Ara Tier III"
	quest.78F33537180B2D6E.quest_desc: [
		"You perform the ritual &3Breaching the Edge of Demon Realm&r and watch in awe as a gateway is assembled in front of you."
		""
		"{image:atm:textures/questpics/neovitae/antechamber_portal.png width:150 height:110 align:center}"
		""
		"Stepping through, you arrive in the &cAntechamber&r: a small section of the &3Demon Realm&r with four doors and simple locks."
	]
	quest.78F33537180B2D6E.quest_subtitle: "Stepping beyond the Threshold"
	quest.78F33537180B2D6E.title: "The Antechamber"
	quest.7D5A6EBC2BBB94F1.quest_desc: ["This is the strongest &dOrb&r in existence, a condiut for rituals once thought to be impossible, backed by ten million &5Anima&r."]
	quest.7D5A6EBC2BBB94F1.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier V"
	quest.7D9CBB016F387B6A.quest_subtitle: "An altar fueled by Hellfire"
	quest.7D9CBB016F387B6A.title: "Reinforced Runes"
	quest.7EFBC608C187C4DE.quest_desc: [
		"Your first offering to the altar is a single diamond. Place it into the &6Ara Vitae&r and stand beside it. It draws from your &4vitality&r to transfigure the offering into a &cNovicius Orb of Vitae&r."
		""
		"The &cOrb&r allows you to willingly sacrifice your &4Essentia Vitae&r, the currency of the blood, to the altar by right-clicking while standing by it, or stores it for later while away. To spare your own veins, an &cOrb of Vitae&r in your off-hand will harvest from those you slay."
	]
	quest.7EFBC608C187C4DE.quest_subtitle: "Orb Tier Zero"
	quest.7F06AA94D8203429.quest_desc: [
		"The Hellfire Forge consumes &bSpiritus&r, reshaping raw malice into tools, equipment, &bgems&r, and many things besides. No Vitaemancer can progress far without one."
		""
		"By this point, you've probably noticed that raw &bSpiritus Essence&r doesn't stack. You'll also want to craft some &bSpiritus Gems&r, which not only save inventory space but are necessary to fuel the Forge with larger quantities of &bSpiritus&r for advanced crafts."
	]
	quest.7F06AA94D8203429.quest_subtitle: "The Vitaemancer's Anvil"
	quest.7F5A61C910DDAFFB.quest_desc: ["As with your &cOrb&r, the capacity of a &bPetty Spiritus Gem&r is acceptable for simple crafts. However, as you progress in the art of Vitaemancy, you'll want to invest in larger &bgems&r."]
	quest.7F5A61C910DDAFFB.title: "Better Spiritus Gems"
	task.03A0A267BBE435EA.title: "Kill the Foreman"
	task.076BFD9CD37072E7.title: "Any Sentient Armor Piece"
	task.1EC0CD3DC4051872.title: "48x Runes"
	task.202F95C25A09C50E.title: "Sulfur Dust"
	task.218A1C9357C5ED19.title: "Any Resonator"
	task.4C22D821E63EF9F7.title: "16x Runes"
	task.4C443B7B56520793.title: "4x Bloodstone Blocks"
	task.632FA8B62978FD9F.title: "72x Runes"
	task.6D5BE02E9FAED45C.title: "AllRightsReserved"
	task.71F56B7D116E5CB9.title: "4x Crystal Clusters"
	task.77D872D6DD03B4C4.title: "28x Runes"
	task.78A6CE5BD71457AD.title: "Any Cutting Fluid"
	task.7DA13EB040BC1C19.title: "AllRightsReserved"
}
